Hi Joseph,

You cannot include a dye effect term in this design, because the 
biological effect and dye effect are completely confounded due to the 
lack of dye swaps. Hence, I believe this design is incapable of 
distinguishing between dye effects and biological effects. The only way 
to proceed would be to make an arbitrary assumption about the dye 
effects (e.g. assume dye effects are zero).

-Ryan

