Hi Ty,

The exon arrays have about 5 million probes. By default, the oligo package
uses only a subset of these probes, which have been flagged as being most
useful. However, the BrainArray package may want to include probes that
are not included by oligo. Thus it may be valuable to start with all
probes (exonarrayTarget=?probeset?) so that all probes included in the
BrainArray mappings will be included. The previous version of SCAN.UPC
uses the default oligo probes.

Regards,
-Steve

