Dear Maria,

No you can't do this.  The reason why we don't tell you which were the top 
genes is that the selection of top genes is different for every pairwise 
comparison between the samples.  For example, if you are plotting ten 
samples, then there are choose(10,2) = 45 different lists of top genes.

Best wishes
Gordon

